-- Applies the nine benchmark queries (Kant et al. 2025, Appendix A.2) to the
-- `policy.l4` encoding of the CODEX hospital income policy.
--
-- Standing preamble applied to every query, per the benchmark's own
-- instructions: "Assuming all other conditions are met and no other
-- exclusions apply (where by 'other,' I mean anything not referenced in the
-- query that follows)," and the agreement has been signed and the premium
-- paid on time.
--
-- Concretely, this means: for every field of `Hospitalization` that a given
-- query does not itself mention, the field below is set to whatever value
-- keeps the policy applying (no unrelated exclusion triggered, no unrelated
-- condition left unsatisfied) so that only the facts the query actually
-- gives can change the answer. Where a query gives no age, a filler age of
-- 30 is used (comfortably under the §3.1(5) cutoff of 80). Where a query
-- gives no hospitalization month and no wellness-confirmation month, a
-- filler hospitalization month of 0 is used (comfortably within every
-- deadline in §1). Where a query names a cause of hospitalization that is
-- not one of the four §3.1 activity exclusions, all four are left FALSE.

IMPORT policy

-- Q1. will my policy apply if I was hospitalized by burns suffered while
-- doing my duty as a firefighter?
q1 MEANS Hospitalization WITH
    `caused by skydiving`                                IS FALSE
    `caused by military service`                         IS FALSE
    `caused by firefighting service`                      IS TRUE   -- burns while on duty as a firefighter: §3.1(3)
    `caused by police service`                            IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                              IS 30     -- unrelated to this query
    `hospitalization month`                               IS 0      -- unrelated to this query
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`  IS FALSE
    `wellness visit confirmation month`                   IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit occurred in time`                     IS TRUE
    `hospital in United States`                           IS TRUE
    `within the 365 day confinement cap`                  IS TRUE

#EVAL `covered` q1

-- Q2. will my policy apply if I am 78 years old at the time of
-- hospitalization?
q2 MEANS Hospitalization WITH
    `caused by skydiving`                                IS FALSE
    `caused by military service`                         IS FALSE
    `caused by firefighting service`                      IS FALSE
    `caused by police service`                            IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                              IS 78     -- under the §3.1(5) cutoff of 80
    `hospitalization month`                               IS 0      -- unrelated to this query
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`  IS FALSE
    `wellness visit confirmation month`                   IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit occurred in time`                     IS TRUE
    `hospital in United States`                           IS TRUE
    `within the 365 day confinement cap`                  IS TRUE

#EVAL `covered` q2

-- Q3. will my policy apply if I was hospitalized for pneumonia 5 months
-- after the policy's effective date, and my age at the time of
-- hospitalization is 65?
q3 MEANS Hospitalization WITH
    `caused by skydiving`                                IS FALSE   -- pneumonia is a sickness, not a §3.1 activity exclusion
    `caused by military service`                         IS FALSE
    `caused by firefighting service`                      IS FALSE
    `caused by police service`                            IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                              IS 65
    `hospitalization month`                               IS 5      -- before the 7-month §1.3 confirmation deadline: still pending, not failed
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`  IS FALSE
    `wellness visit confirmation month`                   IS NOTHING -- not yet due at month 5
    `wellness visit occurred in time`                     IS TRUE
    `hospital in United States`                           IS TRUE
    `within the 365 day confinement cap`                  IS TRUE

#EVAL `covered` q3

-- Q4. will my policy apply if I was hospitalized due to a fall while
-- traveling abroad and I had given confirmation of my wellness visit 8
-- months after the policy's effective date?
q4 MEANS Hospitalization WITH
    `caused by skydiving`                                IS FALSE   -- an accidental fall is not a §3.1 activity exclusion
    `caused by military service`                         IS FALSE
    `caused by firefighting service`                      IS FALSE
    `caused by police service`                            IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                              IS 30      -- unrelated to this query
    `hospitalization month`                               IS 0       -- irrelevant here: confirmation month is known, so the "still pending" fallback is not used
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`  IS FALSE
    `wellness visit confirmation month`                   IS JUST 8  -- given 8 months after the effective date: after the 7-month §1.3 deadline
    `wellness visit occurred in time`                     IS TRUE    -- unrelated to this query
    `hospital in United States`                           IS TRUE    -- §4.1: the policy covers the claimant worldwide; "traveling abroad" describes where the fall happened, not where they were hospitalized, which is unrelated to this query
    `within the 365 day confinement cap`                  IS TRUE

#EVAL `covered` q4

-- Q5. will my policy apply if I was hospitalized for punching my own face to
-- show off for my friends and I did not commit fraud or misrepresentation?
q5 MEANS Hospitalization WITH
    `caused by skydiving`                                IS FALSE   -- no §3.1 ground covers self-inflicted or reckless injury generally
    `caused by military service`                         IS FALSE
    `caused by firefighting service`                      IS FALSE
    `caused by police service`                            IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                              IS 30     -- unrelated to this query
    `hospitalization month`                               IS 0      -- unrelated to this query
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`  IS FALSE  -- given: did not commit fraud or misrepresentation
    `wellness visit confirmation month`                   IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit occurred in time`                     IS TRUE
    `hospital in United States`                           IS TRUE
    `within the 365 day confinement cap`                  IS TRUE

#EVAL `covered` q5

-- Q6. will my policy apply if I was hospitalized due to an injury sustained
-- while skydiving, my age at the time of hospitalization was 79, and proof
-- of my wellness visit was provided 6.5 months after the policy's effective
-- date?
q6 MEANS Hospitalization WITH
    `caused by skydiving`                                IS TRUE    -- §3.1(1)
    `caused by military service`                         IS FALSE
    `caused by firefighting service`                      IS FALSE
    `caused by police service`                            IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                              IS 79
    `hospitalization month`                               IS 0       -- irrelevant here: confirmation month is known
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`  IS FALSE
    `wellness visit confirmation month`                   IS JUST 6.5 -- within the 7-month §1.3 deadline
    `wellness visit occurred in time`                     IS TRUE
    `hospital in United States`                           IS TRUE
    `within the 365 day confinement cap`                  IS TRUE

#EVAL `covered` q6

-- Q7. will my policy apply if I was hospitalized for a heart attack, proof
-- of the wellness visit was submitted 2 months after the policy's effective
-- date, and my age at the time of hospitalization was 75?
q7 MEANS Hospitalization WITH
    `caused by skydiving`                                IS FALSE   -- a heart attack is a sickness, not a §3.1 activity exclusion
    `caused by military service`                         IS FALSE
    `caused by firefighting service`                      IS FALSE
    `caused by police service`                            IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                              IS 75
    `hospitalization month`                               IS 0       -- irrelevant here: confirmation month is known
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`  IS FALSE
    `wellness visit confirmation month`                   IS JUST 2  -- well within the 7-month §1.3 deadline
    `wellness visit occurred in time`                     IS TRUE
    `hospital in United States`                           IS TRUE
    `within the 365 day confinement cap`                  IS TRUE

#EVAL `covered` q7

-- Q8. will my policy apply if I was hospitalized after being injured in a
-- military training exercise, the hospitalization occurred within the
-- policy term, and I did not commit fraud?
q8 MEANS Hospitalization WITH
    `caused by skydiving`                                IS FALSE
    `caused by military service`                         IS TRUE    -- injured in a military training exercise: §3.1(2)
    `caused by firefighting service`                      IS FALSE
    `caused by police service`                            IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                              IS 30      -- unrelated to this query
    `hospitalization month`                               IS 6       -- given: within the policy term (well inside the 12-month §4.6 term)
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`  IS FALSE   -- given: did not commit fraud
    `wellness visit confirmation month`                   IS NOTHING -- unrelated to this query; still pending at month 6
    `wellness visit occurred in time`                     IS TRUE
    `hospital in United States`                           IS TRUE
    `within the 365 day confinement cap`                  IS TRUE

#EVAL `covered` q8

-- Q9. will my policy apply if I was hospitalized due to my son biting me in
-- the ankle, proof of my wellness visit was provided 6 months after the
-- effective date, and I was serving as a police officer at the time of
-- hospitalization?
q9 MEANS Hospitalization WITH
    `caused by skydiving`                                IS FALSE
    `caused by military service`                         IS FALSE
    `caused by firefighting service`                      IS FALSE
    `caused by police service`                            IS FALSE  -- being bitten by one's own son has no causal connection to police service, even though the claimant was serving as a police officer at the time: §3.1(4) requires the injury to arise out of that service, not mere coincidence of employment
    `age at hospitalization`                              IS 30      -- unrelated to this query
    `hospitalization month`                               IS 0       -- irrelevant here: confirmation month is known
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`  IS FALSE
    `wellness visit confirmation month`                   IS JUST 6  -- exactly at the 7-month §1.3 deadline: still timely
    `wellness visit occurred in time`                     IS TRUE
    `hospital in United States`                           IS TRUE
    `within the 365 day confinement cap`                  IS TRUE

#EVAL `covered` q9
